const answerMore = "Your team tests a new build in the morning, we come online at 12:30 pm Japan time, and fixes usually reach TestFlight and Google Play internal testing the same evening. The Japanese text is written or reviewed on your side, while we handle Japanese input, fonts and forms in the code.";
