      `<strong>Progressive web apps (PWAs)</strong> are websites that can be added to the home screen, keep working offline for cached screens and, on current iPhone and Android versions, receive web push notifications once installed. They need no store review, and every update is live immediately. For B2B ordering portals, internal tools on company phones and booking pages linked from Google Maps or Instagram, a PWA is often the better investment. The <a href="/japan/website-developer/">website developer in Japan</a> page covers the web side of these builds.`,
