      `<strong>Japanese store listings.</strong> Both stores let you localise the app name, subtitle, description, keywords, screenshots and preview video for Japanese. The listing is marketing copy, so it should be written by a native speaker; we prepare the structure, screenshot sizes and keyword fields, and your side writes or approves the Japanese. Store search behaves like web search, with kanji, katakana and English variants of the same idea, so the keyword field deserves the same care as a web page title.`,
